msgid "Two certificates. {code0} is 1..1, so the birth visit yields one certificate per vaccine."
msgstr "两份证书。{code0} 的基数为 1..1，因此出生就诊会为每种疫苗产生一份证书。"

#: input/pagecontent/qr_code_generation.md:56
msgid "Two things are worth knowing before picking a number. Subclaims 0 and above are reserved by WHO and are allocated together with a trust domain, through the GDHCN Secretariat. Subclaims that are negative integers are the development range and are free to use, so an implementation using one is a pilot or a development deployment and the number is not guaranteed to be stable."
msgstr "在选择编号之前，有两点值得了解。0 及以上的子声明由世卫组织（WHO）保留，并通过 GDHCN 秘书处与信任域一同分配。负整数子声明属于开发范围，可自由使用，因此使用此类子声明的实现属于试点或开发部署，其编号不保证稳定。"

